Add ``when=`` to ``Source``: a declarative condition that enables a source only when all key→value pairs match after template expansion.  Keys support env-var substitution (``${VAR}``, ``${VAR:-default}``) and cross-source references (``${@tag.key}``).  Disabled sources contribute no data to the merge and do not participate in the cross-ref dependency graph — enabling the prod/dev token pattern without ``if``/``else`` around ``load()``.
